b97f94bf3373b4ba730f47aaa7390f8d292581a50", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-b6098633bd7ac6db212beb47/attachments/solution_text_02.md", "sha256": "bab0814cab4eaa31cad5ab97fbdc99a2c961a60f042ea689d21e4a09d26fad4a", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-b6098633bd7ac6db212beb47", "original_sha256": "71645d039644a7512fe9c80839694fa88e06ed75ee111cf29c4336a212272c51", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-3352d3d2d62cc5d693b8468b", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/97b7998692adf8b143f34314b1b386990c81612c3b8d670c35a3767ba8072215.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "97b7998692adf8b143f34314b1b386990c81612c3b8d670c35a3767ba8072215", "user_turn_count": 2, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 583], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "9d2813270a56de1fe3800b790be35a7bce1e1bbad93918e36fafb134964aa0c9", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 308], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "f66faf885784ae04f1398591dfdc853da66d235bf583ef371359a195107284f0", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "**归档附记：本条消息原附件顺序**\n\n1. `assets/29-05_58016_solution_01.png`。\n2. 29-5 解析二截图（原挂载名 `image.png`；独立原文件未取得，见本题内容转录）。\n3. `assets/29-05_58016_question.png`。\n\n**对话正文（原文）**\n\n这道题我做不出来。\n\n我的想法是求这条直线，用点向式去求。题目给了直线方程 4x = 5y = 6z，我得出来直线的方向向量是 (4, 5, 6)。然后它给了平面方程，平面的法向量是 (7, 8, 9)。\n\n我假设要求的直线方向向量是 λ，已知直线的方向向量是 k1，平面的法向量是 k2：\n\n1. 我可以求出 λ · k1 = 0\n2. λ = ξ · k2（因为它俩平行，所以成比例）\n\n列方程：\n假设 λ 的向量坐标是 (a, b, c)。\n通过 λ · k1 = 0，得到 4a + 5b + 6c = 0。\n又因为 λ = ξ · k2，得到 (7ξ, 8ξ, 9ξ) = (a, b, c)，即 a = 7ξ，b = 8ξ，c = 9ξ。\n\n代入进去算出 ξ = 0，得到方向向量等于 0，这明显不对啊。\n\n你看我哪里出了问题？是我思路出问题了吗？\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.message .assistant #T08}"}